ples, and any "\n            "edge cases or constraints mentioned. Focus on the mathematical or logical "\n            "pattern described in the docstring."\n        )\n        extracted_info = await self.generate(instruction=extraction_instruction, context=self.problem_text)\n\n        # Step 2: Generate an initial solution based on the extracted information\n        initial_solution_instruction = (\n            f"Using the extracted information: {extracted_info}, "\n            "generate a complete Python function implementation that satisfies the problem specification. "\n            "Ensure the function adheres to the provided signature and handles all edge cases mentioned in the docstring. "\n            "Include detailed comments explaining the logic."\n        )\n        initial_solution = await self.generate(instruction=initial_solution_instruction, context=self.problem_text)\n\n        # Step 3: Revise the initial solution for correctness and efficiency\n        revision_instruction = (\n            "Critique the initial solution for correctness, efficiency, and adherence to the problem specification. "\n            "Identify any potential issues, such as off-by-one errors, missing edge cases, or inefficiencies. "\n            "Refine the solution to address these issues."\n        )\n        revised_solution = await self.revise(instruction=revision_instruction, context=initial_solution)\n\n        # Step 4: Summarize the revised solution to ensure clarity and completeness\n        summary_instruction = (\n            "Condense the revised solution into a concise summary that captures the core logic and implementation details. "\n            "Ensure the summary is clear and includes all necessary information for validation."\n        )\n        solution_summary = await self.summarize(instruction=summary_instruction, context=revised_solution)\n\n        # Step 5: Ensemble to select the best solution\n        ensemble_instruction = (\n            "Evaluate th