act all critical information, "\n            "including the function signature, examples, edge cases, and any implicit requirements. "\n            "Focus on identifying the input types, expected output format, and any special conditions. "\n            "Provide a structured summary of these elements."\n        )\n        extracted_info = await self.generate(instruction=extraction_instruction, context=self.problem_text)\n\n        # Step 2: Generate the initial solution based on extracted information\n        generate_instruction = (\n            f"Using the extracted information: {extracted_info}, create a Python function that satisfies the problem specification. "\n            "Ensure the function adheres to the provided signature and handles all edge cases mentioned in the docstring. "\n            "Include detailed comments explaining the logic and reasoning behind the implementation."\n        )\n        initial_solution = await self.generate(instruction=generate_instruction, context=self.problem_text)\n\n        # Step 3: Revise the initial solution for correctness and clarity\n        revise_instruction = (\n            "Review the generated solution and critique it for correctness, clarity, and adherence to the problem specification. "\n            "Identify any potential issues, such as type mismatches, edge case handling, or logical errors. "\n            "Refine the solution to address these issues and improve its readability."\n        )\n        revised_solution = await self.revise(instruction=revise_instruction, context=initial_solution)\n\n        # Step 4: Summarize the final solution to ensure it meets the requirements\n        summarize_instruction = (\n            "Condense the final solution into a concise summary that highlights its key components and ensures it meets the problem\'s requirements. "\n            "Verify that the solution is complete, correct, and ready for testing."\n        )\n        final_summary = await self.summarize(instruc